    "detailed_description": "This easy-to-master motocross racing game is fun for everyone! Play with up to four players!<br><br>Try out each bike's special abilities and take your favorite to the courses!<br><br>Fulfill your need for speed on traditional tracks or tackle rugged courses brimming with nature! You can even create custom courses to make the races your own!<br><br>Drift to take curves and turns like a pro! Nail jumps and mid-air tricks to show everyone what you've got! There's nothing like using your skills to beat your rivals with style.<br><br>[Free Race]<br>Set and keep trying to beat your record times on your favorite track!<br><br>[Grand Prix]<br>Select four tracks to create the ultimate course to battle on for the champion title!<br><br>[Course Creator]<br>Design your very own unique racetracks!<br><br>Up to four players can join in the high-speed fun! Duke it out with friends and family and try to seize first place with flair!",
